      <p><span class="mindset-badge badge-design"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3h12v10H9l-4 4v-4H4Z"/><path d="M7 7h6M7 10h4"/></svg></span>Design</span><span class="mindset-plus">+</span><span class="mindset-badge badge-engineering"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 6-4 4 4 4m6-8 4 4-4 4m-2-9-2 10"/></svg></span>Engineering</span><span>to make it real.</span></p>
      <p><span class="mindset-badge badge-feedback"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3h12v10H9l-4 4v-4H4Z"/><path d="M7 7h6M7 10h4"/></svg></span>Feedback</span><span>to keep making it better.</span></p>
